From c51b0b0ffecb762c36d09241c4341460d4d17d68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FiyeroT <me@fiyero.xyz>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:26:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 55/68] tools: add decode-link, share links to outbounds

sing-box tools decode-link reads vless:// and trojan:// share links, as
arguments or as lines of the standard input, and prints the outbound of each:
TLS and REALITY, the ws, grpc, http, httpupgrade and xhttp transports. For
xhttp the JSON of the "extra" parameter is mapped to the options of the
transport, the download server included, by the rules of Xray-core: the host,
the path and the mode come from the link itself, settings Xray does not know
are ignored, here with a warning.
